## Python Typing Patterns

Pydantic `BaseModel` at every boundary (request bodies, responses, job payloads, parsed provider responses). The type mapping: `uuid` is `UUID`/`sa.Uuid()`; `text` is `str` (`Field(max_length=...)`); `numeric(12,2)` is `Decimal`/`sa.Numeric(12, 2)`, never `float` for money; `timestamptz` is an aware UTC `datetime`/`sa.DateTime(timezone=True)`/`AwareDatetime`; `jsonb` is `dict[str, object]`/`postgresql.JSONB()` or a nested `BaseModel`; an enum type is a `StrEnum`/`postgresql.ENUM(..., name=...)`.

